<title>SWEDEN: AssiDoman to manage Russian firm Segezha.</title>
<headline>AssiDoman to manage Russian firm Segezha.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group AssiDoman AB said on Tuesday it has taken over the operational responsibility for Russian company AO Segezhabumprom.</p>
</text>
